summary:
  Removing the helper's file no longer ends it.

history:
  That is how the widget ends a reading at Stop and at its own teardown,
  without a pid to mistake for somebody else's.

target:
  package/contents/ui/loudness.py

find:
              or not os.path.exists(leash)

replace:
              or os.path.isdir(leash)

expect:
  Killed by tests/test_loudness.py::test_the_helper_stops_when_its_file_is_removed.
  Line-neutral.
